        "created_at": "2017-08-03T20:44:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The targetting of a land occurs when the power is actually used, however, so for example you need not have the energy to pay for targetting a land with Dahan with Shadow's special power until you use the power (somewhere in the slow or fast power phase). &nbsp;Correct?</p>",
