        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"carnilius\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/d07c76/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> carnilius:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The targetting of a land occurs when the power is actually used, however, so for example you need not have the energy to pay for targetting a land with Dahan with Shadow's special power until you use the power (somewhere in the slow or fast power phase). &nbsp;Correct?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Correct, that's one of the examples when you need Energy mid-turn.</p>\n<p>[quote=  carnilius]  Another question – when do you need to pay the energy cost of Serpent's last innate power?[/quote]When you use the power. That's another example.</p>\n<p>Other examples inculde the major power Powerstorm and Call on Midnight's Dreams (Bringer of Dreams and Nightmares).</p>",
